---
// ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// SpiroDivider — the site's signature device.
// A spirometry trace: quiet tidal breathing that rises into a forced
// vital-capacity maneuver (deep inspiration → peak-flow expiration →
// FEV decay) and settles back. The single most recognizable image in
// respiratory medicine, rendered as a section divider.
//
// Props:
//   tone   'light' (default) | 'dark'  — adapts stroke to the surface
//   label  optional caption shown beneath the trace
// Draws itself on scroll (pure CSS, reduced-motion safe); visible by
// default if scroll-driven animation isn't supported.
// ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
const { tone = 'light', label } = Astro.props;
const uid = 'spiro-' + Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 8);
